      "form_language": "A gently inflated pebble form with continuous convex surfaces, a soft waistline and no hard edges. The slim profile is achieved by a shallow, uniform wall and a subtly tapered back cover. The front face is a calm, uninterrupted surface with a large rounded-rectangle display window centrally placed and a low-profile intake louvre band beneath it. The USB-C port sits on the right-hand side face, recessed into a small chamfer. The overall impression is friendly, organic and approachable, with a light texture that reads as a soft matte skin.",
