      "rationale": "This concept adapts the DFM-approved reference desk unit into a softer pebble form per the soft_pebble direction. The envelope is slightly reduced in height (26 mm) to emphasise the slim profile while staying within the 125 x 75 x 30 mm limit. The corner radius is increased to 12 mm to achieve the friendly, organic feel. The display window is enlarged to 52 x 26 mm and placed in the upper-middle front to ensure readability from a neighbouring desk (approx. 1.5 m). The intake is a low-profile louvre band on the front face, integrated subtly to avoid disrupting the pebble surface. USB-C is on the right side for easy access. Material is rABS with a light texture finish to hide fingerprints and meet sustainability goals; a pad-printed logo adds brand identity without cost impact. The design stays within the CNY 18 BOM ceiling by using a single main shell, standard electronics, and minimal secondary operations. Mass is estimated at ~165 g, within the 180 g limit."
